{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1635516073"}, "name":{"label":"Mama Bear hugs"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-23T07:48:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.94.0"}, "id":{"label":"14584265944"}, "title":{"label":"Needed to drink more"}, "content":{"label":"Having had Renal Cell Carcinoma in 2023, which resulted in a Radical Nephrectomy, I needed to drink more water, not my usual tea (including Black; Hyssop; Ceylon; Jasmine; Oolong; Green etc)… I’ve always found water to be boring and the past three weeks I have fallen far short of my recommended water intake.\nDay one of this app has gone really well so far, had a liter of water before I got up, 500ml tea and 300ml semi skimmed milk with my lunch, now into my second liter. Thanks 😊", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1827204261"}, "name":{"label":"marl!! 🎀"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-23T07:37:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.94.0"}, "id":{"label":"14584227045"}, "title":{"label":"Waterllama"}, "content":{"label":"I like this app because it tracks your water (even though I tend to forget) I am asking for one thing; if there could be more free stuff! I don’t like paying for apps as over time I might stop using it then it was pointless, and I use money on real things rather than digital things. If more free stuff, then I would probably remember a lot more and I would feel better without loads of popups saying get the vip but yeah that’s all I have got to say", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
