{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1710971844"}, "name":{"label":"Lemon tea rain"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-29T19:57:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.93.0"}, "id":{"label":"14364851421"}, "title":{"label":"Promising, but.."}, "content":{"label":"The app seems promising at first, but since there are no alternative beverages beyond plain water in the free version, the free version isn’t worth using unless water is all you drink. I wish there were at least two or three alternatives that you could select in the free version, such as soda and coffee, to start shaping an idea of your intake habits and get a taste of the app’s ability to track these. As it is now, I’m too worried about not liking the feature or using it long term to be willing to purchase access to it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
