{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id256711175"}, "name":{"label":"Mrs Moppo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-15T03:32:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.92.6"}, "id":{"label":"14185100050"}, "title":{"label":"Great app; simpler icon for apple watch, please!"}, "content":{"label":"Hi Waterllama Team, I am a premium subscriber, and I absolutely love using your app to track my water, tea, and coffee intake. The ability to program the exact capacities of my custom mugs and vessels is incredibly useful and keeps my tracking perfectly accurate. However, I have run into a bit of a snag regarding the aesthetics. I have successfully changed the app icon on my iPhone to the minimalist \"glass of water\" option, which fits my style much better than the cartoon llama character. Unfortunately, this custom icon does not sync to my Apple Watch Series 11, meaning the cartoon llama icon still stubbornly appears in my watch’s app list. As an older user who prefers a cleaner, more mature aesthetic, would you consider adding a feature that syncs the iPhone's custom app icon choice to the Apple Watch app? A minimalist or \"Pro\" icon option for the watch list and complications would be greatly appreciated by many of us who love your app's utility but prefer a simpler look. Thank you for your hard work and for creating such a helpful tracking tool!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
